{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得的，是曾经真心相信过的那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心相信过\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想和人亲近时不用提防，珍惜的东西也不用靠争抢才能留住。\",\n      \"key\": \"不用提防\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着被爱、被接纳时不用证明自己够好，付出只因喜欢。\",\n      \"key\": \"不用证明\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再因仍盼着这样的生活而羞愧。\",\n      \"key\": \"仍盼着\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时不再追着自己问个明白。\",\n      \"key\": \"问个明白\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他压了很久的渴望渐渐涌上来，心里满足起来，也没那么绷着了。\",\n      \"key\": \"渴望渐渐涌上来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里安稳下来，先前的疲惫暂时退远。\",\n      \"key\": \"安稳下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"删重并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去与前段重复的松开逼迫和承认不舍，只留下不舍的对象。改由S04-2说明他曾真实体验过亲近与欢喜，因此真心相信过这样的生活。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\", \"S06-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简\",\n      \"why\": \"保留人与人之间不必提防、珍惜之物不靠争抢，以及不必证明自己值得被爱、付出只因喜欢这两个不同侧面。删去S06-3与S06-2重叠的防备受伤。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\", \"R28\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"收窄\",\n      \"why\": \"曾经真实的亲近与欢喜已由S04-2交代，此处只留下他不再因仍然向往而羞愧，避免重复陈述过去的体验和允许自己向往。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简并调整箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"把连续盘问的清单收束为暂时停止追问。原先S04-3只能解释他怕得不到，不能直接解释他停止自我盘问，改由S05-5所写的松开逼迫、承认不舍提供理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R30\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留压抑已久的渴望渐渐浮现、满足感和身体放松，去掉与停止盘问重复的自我许可，以及替他总结人格变化的对照。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R31\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"删改\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安稳下来、疲惫暂时退远的感受，删去一时只想多留一会儿，避免把静谧的意象写成他想继续停留的动作。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "457d3736-61f1-4459-ac30-93c23f8fc96a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T081151753674Z", "elapsed_seconds": 398.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:18:29.803169+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6faa71472147739747d22680a361f251df6c7187bb84b0e29710b0d2045be0a2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842